{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:12.45.110","page_type":"section"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"49f6e1a454937d1eda77bd3cc1faea3c6ff6c0413d989b4adf2bc3ce440f827c","heading":"Prohibited acts.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(a) In addition to the suspension or revocation of a license available to the City under TMC 12.45.120 , it shall be unlawful for any person or contractor licensed by the City, its employee, agent or subcontractor to cause, permit or allow the following:\n(1) Fail to obtain the proper permit;\n(2) Fail to complete all work within the specified permit limits;\n(3) Fail to restore the right-of-way or easement to the same condition that existed prior to commencement of the work authorized by the permit;\n(4) Fail to establish traffic control in accordance with the Manual of Uniform Traffic Control, current City-approved edition, or such other rules, regulations, or restrictions promulgated by the City Engineer;\n(5) Fail to notify the City of Topeka, Engineering Division construction management, of the commencement of work authorized by the permit;\n(6) Fail to execute work in accordance with the City of Topeka Standard Technical Specifications and Detail Drawings, latest edition;\n(7) To remove or interfere with any traffic control device in the right-of-way;\n(8) To cut, damage or break any curb, gutter or sidewalk unless authorized under a permit issued by the City;\n(9) To interfere with traffic in violation of TMC 12.45.080 ;\n(10) To hinder or obstruct the repair or construction of any public improvement or other work in the City’s right-of-way pursuant to any permit issued under this article; or\n(11) Fail to remove an existing obsolete driveway approach.\n(b) Any person violating this section may be punished by:\n(1) A fine of not more than $499.00;\n(2) Imprisonment in jail for not more than 179 days; or\n(3) Both such fine and imprisonment not to exceed the limits set out in subsections (b)(1) and (b)(2) of this section.\n(c) Provided, however, contractors holding a valid license with the City shall be given notice of a violation with opportunity to cure in accordance with the provisions of TMC 12.45.120(b) prior to prosecution under this section.\n(d) Provided, however, entities holding a valid franchise agreement with the City shall be given notice of a violation and an opportunity to cure in accordance with the franchise agreement prior to prosecution under this section. (Ord. 19370 § 89, 3-23-10. Code 1995 § 130-163.)\nCross References: City Engineer, TMC 2.20.100 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"21edee61-0644-52e4-8380-bb6ef3dc616e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"a6a55dfe147174ebe1841724c3e533f7d169ad3b05cc29140da5ad77d7ed4bc2","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(a) In addition to the suspension or revocation of a license available to the City under TMC 12.45.120 , it shall be unlawful for any person or contractor licensed by the City, its employee, agent or subcontractor to cause, permit or allow the following:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"ed098715-9204-5dee-8b42-b102d19ce76d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"e4ff9b0d7b76e439d1586ec29b78b5e0c2886faa5aec5ea3c20b0096addac36d","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(1) Fail to obtain the proper permit;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"275f0116-5ef3-56d1-a63f-66a090cdf3ba"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"4f1c0a420849571254cd17d2213f63056f598acf8a3a5dfb164e3804e5255459","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(2) Fail to complete all work within the specified permit limits;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"ef4edf75-c191-5885-9f5f-e9498fe222ef"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"ce8ea0acb950d2109a9fd25581ff604169535bc3ae771acc44c773a870252a08","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(3) Fail to restore the right-of-way or easement to the same condition that existed prior to commencement of the work authorized by the permit;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"bcf3ce99-fdaf-54fc-b131-a533c00aa824"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"a51f649016293602ce948c2385eed44525b5774e1daeeefd8ce5349f47bedfb7","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(4) Fail to establish traffic control in accordance with the Manual of Uniform Traffic Control, current City-approved edition, or such other rules, regulations, or restrictions promulgated by the City Engineer;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4dd28c83-f757-5e3a-92f8-e0d0bd4c0455"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"dba207824896890dacdcf19f4b716d22e0db6a5788327b36b20d7549685de67a","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(5) Fail to notify the City of Topeka, Engineering Division construction management, of the commencement of work authorized by the permit;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"249b02f4-7ca7-5c2d-bc1c-a5ee39bf6bc7"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"bbde764d917a7555821ed2fe10074d48b6cabed1cbf7a3b1221e618b8f1ac019","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(6) Fail to execute work in accordance with the City of Topeka Standard Technical Specifications and Detail Drawings, latest edition;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"8b1015db-161f-5578-80e1-8f3c995d7301"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"be3936c59c92291c41b110b068c7e56d2842a3b5b19b463f26f887ba2b9e6367","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(7) To remove or interfere with any traffic control device in the right-of-way;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"31ce4e0f-99aa-5978-ad3c-cb4ef32e6be0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"b3c5ef8d837e3b104fa21bdac366cea5bdbd6c375505f41a0c9519505215feb8","heading":null,"ordinal":8,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:8","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(8) To cut, damage or break any curb, gutter or sidewalk unless authorized under a permit issued by the City;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2c0b192e-9ee6-51c1-9c93-458a243166d1"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"07a26ad770b20033c523c215ee36a55165086b50b210992c703091929c645b5c","heading":null,"ordinal":9,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:9","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(9) To interfere with traffic in violation of TMC 12.45.080 ;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"9485c65d-a4c9-530b-89ad-6211f5121719"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"f2a2ff9c55e3879af3d19a1deeef9fd7737d8f61c9c4c8126583fbd085fff626","heading":null,"ordinal":10,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:10","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(10) To hinder or obstruct the repair or construction of any public improvement or other work in the City’s right-of-way pursuant to any permit issued under this article; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"3e325d02-c8f4-5de0-8f96-9973a104cf86"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"b2d647d40a6f489a711d2a3b3b68d794dac605992e31fdfea13c57273fce5685","heading":null,"ordinal":11,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:11","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(11) Fail to remove an existing obsolete driveway approach.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e3d44fe8-cf4c-5324-8c31-1af80b00306a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"d6782c276bbfd25253901ee7a9db6d10ec80a515d4e2036d84499b90827a07ab","heading":null,"ordinal":12,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:12","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(b) Any person violating this section may be punished by:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"9b490d29-6579-5cb2-bb66-eb7bec1aadd1"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"c698bb7e4b668e5c9c83a76b40cd0dcf6985459c1f1db4d86db9a7a1356bb119","heading":null,"ordinal":13,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:13","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(1) A fine of not more than $499.00;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"758aaaba-409c-5ba9-bfd7-e5ddc3fe3e39"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"ed8e8c1a03f2b2b2df407b74d64d4d7ca431436a8431adfbc31b63e101b6a20e","heading":null,"ordinal":14,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:14","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(2) Imprisonment in jail for not more than 179 days; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b183d112-5965-5345-9e99-112c0978023b"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"f6e2e66e078fbb828cf4eddc3ce6191a143a4ce21b9b1e49a03317b98007ce25","heading":null,"ordinal":15,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:15","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(3) Both such fine and imprisonment not to exceed the limits set out in subsections (b)(1) and (b)(2) of this section.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"0d38f630-394b-5d9a-ac89-dda5440eec0a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"07ef07ba1df6b981ec0624402e48cc584fcc528f0fd5744d20bfc694470a8731","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(c) Provided, however, contractors holding a valid license with the City shall be given notice of a violation with opportunity to cure in accordance with the provisions of TMC 12.45.120(b) prior to prosecution under this section.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"7e292560-bd08-5432-896f-95237e56768e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"920576a445bbd0760bab302b1b822e8132c4f2e39988ac6a105bdcdd2087333b","heading":null,"ordinal":17,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:17","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"(d) Provided, however, entities holding a valid franchise agreement with the City shall be given notice of a violation and an opportunity to cure in accordance with the franchise agreement prior to prosecution under this section. (Ord. 19370 § 89, 3-23-10. Code 1995 § 130-163.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"fcb5d2a5-0085-5de7-b73b-0da593b0773b"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.45.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","content_hash":"d4427e504f2e5c54644b6da2040b0bacf91fbca639c62b9d157a54291ca07463","heading":null,"ordinal":18,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:18","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.45.110","text":"Cross References: City Engineer, TMC 2.20.100 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"cf596641-bfff-5f3f-840f-93aaad07fc6b"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}